"An app is a JSON object in the ``apps`` array. The schema only enforces "
"``id`` and ``label`` as universally required, plus a docker-specific "
"block — but the catalog convention is to **fill every field** so each "
"entry carries a complete dashboard listing. The only practical "
"exceptions:"
