msgid "Working on the catalog locally"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/developers/apps/app_catalog.rst:272
msgid ""
"The catalog files use canonical ``JSON.stringify(parsed, null, 2)`` "
"formatting (2-space indent, one-element arrays expanded, trailing "
"newline). A ``.prettierignore`` keeps editor formatters off them, and CI "
"rejects PRs that don't match. Install the pre-commit hooks once so "
"problems are caught before they fail CI:"
msgstr ""

